Quest 770 "[Lemegeton] Devil 1 Great Devil Bael"
    Journal "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Kill 1 of 9219, 9146

Requires player level >= 75 and player is elmorad and quest 768 is completed

Rewards
    Give 77500000 experience
    Give 100000 coins
    Give 50 np
    Give 1 of 900106000

On available
    Say "You've sealed 71 Devils. There's only one more. Go visit Seis for the last mission."

On offer
    Show quest "You are here! We're almost done with this.\n\nThis is the final stage. Only the most colossal enemy remains. That is [Devil 1] Demon King Bael. He is the Demon King who rules the East, commanding 66 legions and a master of swordsmanship, reigning supreme as the 1st in rank among all demons. To end this Demon War, you must seal him. Take the [Devil 1 Lord Summoning Scroll] I gave you and find the [Devil 1 Summoning Stone] here in [Ronark Land]. Then, summon him and settle the score. I wish you luck. Bring this war to an end.\n\nYou have to receive [Devil 1 Summoning Scroll] from [Order of the sorcery] Seis, of Ronark Land. Then, summon [Devil 1] Bael from [Devil 1 Summoning Stone] at El Morad Castle area and kill him. \n※ [Devil 1 Summoning Scroll] is free the first time, but from the next time on you'll have to pay a million Noahs."

On in_progress
    Say "[Devil1] Bael's Army is still alive. Please end the war."

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you! Now the War will end! Thank you again!\n\nDo you remember the monk [Order of the Sorcery Leader] Pelore? He wants to see you, <selfname>. He wants to award you, probably. He'll also tell you how we can forever seal the Devils."
